# The phone stops sending audio when nothing is playing. That pause must not be mistaken for a network
# stall: after the sound resumes the buffer stays small and nothing counts as a dropout.
expect Lab: note audio resumed
expect Audio: buffer target [0-9]{2} ms \(peak gap [0-9]{1,2} ms\).*underruns 0
expect-not peak gap [0-9]{4,} ms
expect-not Audio: buffer target (1[5-9][0-9]|2[0-9][0-9]|300) ms
expect-not Lab: FAIL
0     video ../fixtures/portrait.h265
0     audio ../fixtures/tone.m4a
5000  audio-stop
9000  audio ../fixtures/tone.m4a
9000  log audio resumed
21000 quit
